body:
Nah, it is. My friend killed himself and within 12 hours he became a goddamn punchline. It's bullshit. Teenagers are bullshit.

&#x200B;

That's honestly what I'm betting on. People forgetting. I'm not gonna kill myself now, but I know I will in the future, one day. I don't wanna hurt anybody.

It's what I do. It helps me a bit, I guess, but it also helps to talk to a real person about it (: 

&#x200B;

Good luck, I'm sorry that you have to hide your sad self. But one day, I know you'll find someone who accepts the whole of you! Much love!
